A big update before the game is released into Early Access.	

We’ve listened to the remarks and wishes that came from our beta testers over the past month and made some corrections and improvements in the game:

    added a completely new solution to one of the tasks of the main quest (yes, almost all tasks can be solved in different ways);
    added more than 20 sounds;
    improved part of the sounds;
    added and improved some animations of Leah and other characters;
    fixed some minor bugs.


 The game is released on March 1. We are looking forward to your feedback and opinions! 

 Artem Vodoriz and Gingertips Team.

